#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:2
msgid "Edge Site Management Strategy"
msgstr "Estrategia de gestión de sitios edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:7
msgid ""
"Large-scale deployments often span multiple geographic regions, data "
"centers, and edge locations. |morpheus| supports a three-tier management "
"architecture that scales from a single appliance to a fully federated multi-"
"region deployment:"
msgstr ""
"Las implementaciones a gran escala suelen abarcar múltiples regiones "
"geográficas, centros de datos y ubicaciones edge. |morpheus| admite una "
"arquitectura de gestión de tres niveles que escala desde un único "
"dispositivo hasta una implementación multirregión totalmente federada:"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:13
msgid "Tier"
msgstr "Nivel"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:14
msgid "Component"
msgstr "Componente"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:15
msgid "Role"
msgstr "Función"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:16
msgid "Tier 1 — Federated Management"
msgstr "Nivel 1: gestión federada"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:17
msgid "Morpheus Central"
msgstr "Morpheus Central"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:18
msgid ""
"Single pane of glass across multiple regional |morpheus| Managers. Provides "
"federated visibility, license management, and cross-region coordination."
msgstr ""
"Panel único de control para múltiples Managers regionales de |morpheus|. "
"Proporciona visibilidad federada, gestión de licencias y coordinación entre "
"regiones."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:19
msgid "Tier 2 — Regional Management"
msgstr "Nivel 2: gestión regional"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:20
msgid "|morpheus| Manager (Appliance)"
msgstr "Manager de |morpheus| (dispositivo)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:21
msgid ""
"Full lifecycle management for a region or data center. Handles provisioning,"
" governance, automation, and user access for all clouds and infrastructure "
"within its scope."
msgstr ""
"Gestión del ciclo de vida completo para una región o centro de datos. Se "
"encarga del aprovisionamiento, la gobernanza, la automatización y el acceso "
"de usuarios para todas las nubes e infraestructura dentro de su alcance."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:22
msgid "Tier 3 — Edge Proxy"
msgstr "Nivel 3: proxy edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:23
msgid "Distributed Workers"
msgstr "Distributed Workers"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:24
msgid ""
"Lightweight proxy nodes deployed at edge locations, remote sites, or "
"isolated network segments. Relay Cloud API traffic, Agent communication, "
"console sessions, and quorum witness services back to the regional Manager."
msgstr ""
"Nodos proxy ligeros implementados en ubicaciones edge, sitios remotos o "
"segmentos de red aislados. Retransmiten el tráfico de la API de nube, la "
"comunicación del Agent, las sesiones de consola y los servicios de testigo "
"de quórum de vuelta al Manager regional."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:27
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Arquitectura"

