#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:50
msgid "Tier 3: Distributed Workers at the Edge"
msgstr "Nivel 3: Distributed Workers en el edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:52
msgid ""
"Distributed Workers are the foundation of edge site management. Each Worker "
"is a lightweight service deployed at a remote or edge location that "
"maintains an outbound connection to its regional |morpheus| Manager. Workers"
" proxy:"
msgstr ""
"Los Distributed Workers son la base de la gestión de sitios edge. Cada "
"Worker es un servicio ligero implementado en una ubicación remota o edge que"
" mantiene una conexión saliente hacia su Manager regional de |morpheus|. Los"
" Workers actúan como proxy de:"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Cloud API traffic** — Communicates with local hypervisors (VMware, HVM, "
"Nutanix, SCVMM, Hyper-V, OpenStack, etc.) on behalf of the regional Manager"
msgstr ""
"**Tráfico de la API de nube** — Se comunica con los hipervisores locales "
"(VMware, HVM, Nutanix, SCVMM, Hyper-V, OpenStack, etc.) en nombre del "
"Manager regional"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Agent relay** — Relays |morpheus| Agent traffic from managed VMs back to "
"the Manager"
msgstr ""
"**Retransmisión del Agent** — Retransmite el tráfico del Agent de |morpheus|"
" desde las VM gestionadas de vuelta al Manager"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Console gateway** — Routes browser-based console sessions to local VMs "
"without requiring direct connectivity from user browsers to the hypervisor "
"network"
msgstr ""
"**Gateway de consola** — Enruta las sesiones de consola basadas en navegador"
" hacia las VM locales sin requerir conectividad directa desde los "
"navegadores de los usuarios a la red del hipervisor"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:57
msgid ""
"**HVM quorum witness** — Provides witness services for two-node or stretch "
"HVM clusters at edge sites"
msgstr ""
"**Testigo de quórum de HVM** — Proporciona servicios de testigo para "
"clústeres HVM de dos nodos o extendidos en sitios edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:59
msgid "**When to deploy a Worker at an edge site:**"
msgstr "**Cuándo implementar un Worker en un sitio edge:**"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:61
msgid ""
"The regional Manager cannot directly reach the hypervisor management network"
" at the edge location"
msgstr ""
"El Manager regional no puede alcanzar directamente la red de gestión del "
"hipervisor en la ubicación edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:62
msgid "Agent traffic from edge VMs cannot route directly to the Manager"
msgstr ""
"El tráfico del Agent de las VM edge no puede enrutarse directamente al "
"Manager"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:63
msgid "Users need console access to VMs at edge sites without VPN"
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios necesitan acceso a la consola de las VM en sitios edge sin VPN"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:64
msgid ""
"Network segmentation or firewall policy requires all traffic to egress "
"through a known endpoint"
msgstr ""
"La segmentación de red o la política de firewall requiere que todo el "
"tráfico salga a través de un endpoint conocido"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:65
msgid ""
"HVM clusters at edge sites need a remote quorum witness for availability"
msgstr ""
"Los clústeres HVM en sitios edge necesitan un testigo de quórum remoto para "
"la disponibilidad"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:67
msgid "**Deployment considerations:**"
msgstr "**Consideraciones de implementación:**"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:69
msgid "Workers require only outbound HTTPS (TCP 443) to the regional Manager"
msgstr ""
"Los Workers solo requieren HTTPS saliente (TCP 443) hacia el Manager "
"regional"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:70
msgid ""
"Multiple Workers can share the same Worker key for HA at a single edge site"
msgstr ""
"Varios Workers pueden compartir la misma clave de Worker para HA en un único"
" sitio edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:71
msgid ""
"A single Worker can serve multiple roles (cloud proxy, console gateway, "
"witness)"
msgstr ""
"Un único Worker puede cumplir varias funciones (proxy de nube, gateway de "
"consola, testigo)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:72
msgid ""
"Separate Workers per role may be preferred for fault isolation or "
"independent scaling"
msgstr ""
"Se pueden preferir Workers separados por función para el aislamiento de "
"fallos o el escalado independiente"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:74
msgid ""
"For installation, configuration, and HA deployment details, see "
":doc:`/administration/integrations/workers`. For two-Host GFS2 witness "
"operations, see :doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters`. For "
"stretch-cluster witness operations, see "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters`."
msgstr ""
"Para conocer los detalles de instalación, configuración e implementación de "
"HA, consulte :doc:`/administration/integrations/workers`. Para las "
"operaciones de testigo de dos hosts GFS2, consulte "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters`. Para las operaciones "
"de testigo de clústeres extendidos, consulte "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters`."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:77
msgid "Tier 2: Regional Morpheus Managers"
msgstr "Nivel 2: Managers regionales de Morpheus"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:79
msgid ""
"Each region, data center, or major campus operates its own |morpheus| "
"Manager appliance (or HA appliance cluster). The regional Manager:"
msgstr ""
"Cada región, centro de datos o campus principal opera su propio dispositivo "
"Manager de |morpheus| (o clúster de dispositivos HA). El Manager regional:"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:81
msgid "Owns all cloud integrations, groups, and tenants for its scope"
msgstr ""
"Posee todas las integraciones de nube, grupos y tenants dentro de su alcance"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:82
msgid "Handles provisioning, automation, governance, and policy enforcement"
msgstr ""
"Gestiona el aprovisionamiento, la automatización, la gobernanza y la "
"aplicación de políticas"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:83
msgid ""
"Manages its own set of Distributed Workers deployed at edge locations within"
" the region"
msgstr ""
"Gestiona su propio conjunto de Distributed Workers implementados en "
"ubicaciones edge dentro de la región"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:84
msgid ""
"Operates independently if connectivity to Morpheus Central is interrupted"
msgstr ""
"Opera de forma independiente si se interrumpe la conectividad con Morpheus "
"Central"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:86
msgid "**Sizing guidance:**"
msgstr "**Guía de dimensionamiento:**"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:88
msgid ""
"A single Manager can manage thousands of VMs across many Distributed Workers"
msgstr ""
"Un único Manager puede gestionar miles de VM a través de muchos Distributed "
"Workers"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:89
msgid ""
"Deploy additional regional Managers when geographic latency, compliance "
"boundaries, or blast-radius requirements demand independent control planes"
msgstr ""
"Implemente Managers regionales adicionales cuando la latencia geográfica, "
"los límites de cumplimiento o los requisitos de radio de impacto exijan "
"planos de control independientes"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:90
msgid ""
"Each Manager maintains its own database, elasticsearch, and RabbitMQ (or HA "
"equivalents)"
msgstr ""
"Cada Manager mantiene su propia base de datos, elasticsearch y RabbitMQ (o "
"equivalentes HA)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:92
msgid ""
"For appliance installation and HA configuration, see "
":doc:`/getting_started/ha/ha`."
msgstr ""
"Para la instalación del dispositivo y la configuración de HA, consulte "
":doc:`/getting_started/ha/ha`."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:95
msgid "Tier 1: Morpheus Central (Federated Management)"
msgstr "Nivel 1: Morpheus Central (gestión federada)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:97
msgid ""
"Morpheus Central provides a federated management layer that connects "
"multiple regional Managers into a single organizational view:"
msgstr ""
"Morpheus Central proporciona una capa de gestión federada que conecta varios"
" Managers regionales en una única vista organizativa:"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:99
msgid ""
"**Unified visibility** — View infrastructure, instances, and operations "
"across all registered regions from a single interface"
msgstr ""
"**Visibilidad unificada** — Vea la infraestructura, las instancias y las "
"operaciones de todas las regiones registradas desde una única interfaz"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:100
msgid ""
"**License management** — Centralized license allocation and consumption "
"tracking across all Managers"
msgstr ""
"**Gestión de licencias** — Asignación centralizada de licencias y "
"seguimiento del consumo en todos los Managers"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Cross-region coordination** — Federated reporting, compliance visibility, "
"and operational awareness"
msgstr ""
"**Coordinación entre regiones** — Informes federados, visibilidad de "
"cumplimiento y conocimiento operativo"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:103
msgid ""
"Each regional Manager registers with Morpheus Central via |AdmSet| (Morpheus"
" Central tab). Registration requires outbound HTTPS connectivity from the "
"Manager to the Central service."
msgstr ""
"Cada Manager regional se registra en Morpheus Central a través de |AdmSet| "
"(pestaña Morpheus Central). El registro requiere conectividad HTTPS saliente"
" desde el Manager hacia el servicio Central."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:105
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:107
msgid ""
"Morpheus Central is a federated visibility and coordination layer. Each "
"regional Manager retains full autonomy for provisioning, automation, and "
"day-to-day operations. Central does not replace or override regional Manager"
" functionality."
msgstr ""
"Morpheus Central es una capa de visibilidad y coordinación federada. Cada "
"Manager regional conserva total autonomía para el aprovisionamiento, la "
"automatización y las operaciones diarias. Central no reemplaza ni anula la "
"funcionalidad del Manager regional."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:110
msgid "Deployment Patterns"
msgstr "Patrones de implementación"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:113
msgid "Single Region with Edge Sites"
msgstr "Región única con sitios edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:115
msgid ""
"The simplest pattern: one Manager with multiple Workers at remote sites."
msgstr ""
"El patrón más simple: un Manager con varios Workers en sitios remotos."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:117
msgid "1 |morpheus| Manager (data center or central office)"
msgstr "1 Manager de |morpheus| (centro de datos u oficina central)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:118
msgid "N Distributed Workers (one per edge site or remote network zone)"
msgstr "N Distributed Workers (uno por sitio edge o zona de red remota)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:119
msgid "Workers proxy cloud and agent traffic from edge hypervisors"
msgstr ""
"Los Workers actúan como proxy del tráfico de nube y del Agent desde los "
"hipervisores edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:122
msgid "Multi-Region with Edge Sites"
msgstr "Multirregión con sitios edge"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:124
msgid "For organizations spanning multiple geographies:"
msgstr "Para organizaciones que abarcan varias geografías:"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:126
msgid "1 Morpheus Central instance"
msgstr "1 instancia de Morpheus Central"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:127
msgid "N |morpheus| Managers (one per region)"
msgstr "N Managers de |morpheus| (uno por región)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:128
msgid ""
"M Distributed Workers per region (at edge locations within each region)"
msgstr ""
"M Distributed Workers por región (en ubicaciones edge dentro de cada región)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:130
msgid "This pattern provides:"
msgstr "Este patrón proporciona:"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:132
msgid "Regional autonomy (each Manager operates independently)"
msgstr "Autonomía regional (cada Manager opera de forma independiente)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:133
msgid "Edge reach (Workers extend each Manager to remote sites)"
msgstr "Alcance edge (los Workers extienden cada Manager a sitios remotos)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:134
msgid "Federated oversight (Central provides cross-region visibility)"
msgstr "Supervisión federada (Central proporciona visibilidad entre regiones)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:137
msgid "Compliance-Driven Segmentation"
msgstr "Segmentación basada en cumplimiento"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:139
msgid ""
"For environments with strict data sovereignty or compliance boundaries:"
msgstr ""
"Para entornos con estrictos límites de soberanía de datos o cumplimiento:"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:141
msgid "Separate Managers per compliance zone (e.g., one for EMEA, one for US)"
msgstr ""
"Managers separados por zona de cumplimiento (por ejemplo, uno para EMEA y "
"otro para EE. UU.)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:142
msgid ""
"Workers within each zone cannot communicate with Managers in other zones"
msgstr ""
"Los Workers de cada zona no pueden comunicarse con Managers de otras zonas"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:143
msgid ""
"Central provides visibility across zones without moving workload data across"
" boundaries"
msgstr ""
"Central proporciona visibilidad entre zonas sin mover los datos de las "
"cargas de trabajo a través de los límites"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:146
msgid "Planning Checklist"
msgstr "Lista de verificación de planificación"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:152
msgid "Question"
msgstr "Pregunta"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:153
msgid "Guidance"
msgstr "Guía"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:154
msgid "How many geographic regions or compliance zones?"
msgstr "¿Cuántas regiones geográficas o zonas de cumplimiento?"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:155
msgid "One Manager per region or zone"
msgstr "Un Manager por región o zona"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:156
msgid "How many edge sites per region?"
msgstr "¿Cuántos sitios edge por región?"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:157
msgid "One or more Workers per edge site (HA pairs for critical sites)"
msgstr "Uno o más Workers por sitio edge (pares HA para sitios críticos)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:158
msgid "Do edge sites have HVM clusters?"
msgstr "¿Los sitios edge tienen clústeres HVM?"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:159
msgid ""
"Deploy a Worker with witness capability (separate from cloud proxy if "
"desired)"
msgstr ""
"Implemente un Worker con capacidad de testigo (independiente del proxy de "
"nube si se desea)"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:160
msgid "Do users need console access to edge VMs?"
msgstr "¿Los usuarios necesitan acceso a la consola de las VM edge?"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:161
msgid "Configure Workers as console gateways"
msgstr "Configure los Workers como gateways de consola"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:162
msgid "Is cross-region visibility required?"
msgstr "¿Se requiere visibilidad entre regiones?"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:163
msgid "Deploy Morpheus Central"
msgstr "Implemente Morpheus Central"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:164
msgid "What is the blast radius tolerance?"
msgstr "¿Cuál es la tolerancia al radio de impacto?"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/edge_site_management.rst:165
msgid "Separate Managers reduce the impact of a single Manager failure"
msgstr "Managers separados reducen el impacto de un único fallo de Manager"
